WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Fictional example. Real screen recording.
No presenter or narration.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Enter the fictional birth date:
15 May 1990.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose Known, then enter 09:30.
This is the birthplace's local time.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Search for New Delhi, India.
Wait for the city matches.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Select the New Delhi match.
Saving on this device stays off.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Select Calculate free.
Wait for the actual calculator result.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
This example returns Gemini rising
and a Sagittarius Moon.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
No email, account or payment is used.
The chart checks are free.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Calculated positions and astrological
meaning are different, not promises.
